{"unit_id":"llafztq__dsh-video-tool#card-zh","repo":"llafztq/dsh-video-tool","commit":"9be77de28cb57034217615dfd40143800bdd3841","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-video-tool（DSH 插件，适用于 DSH 客户端）：为 DSH 增加基于 ffmpeg 的视频与音频处理工具。它通过注册九个工具接入会话，可检查媒体信息、裁剪和拼接片段、处理音轨、烧录文字或字幕、变换画面并导出多种格式，也能抽取画面供 read_image 查看。适合希望在 DSH 工作流中直接整理视频素材、制作片段或提取关键帧的用户。首次使用需准备 ffmpeg/ffprobe；若本机找不到，插件会下载并缓存引擎，也可手动配置路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:803-976","index.mjs:215-275","index.mjs:489-525"]}
{"unit_id":"llafztq__dsh-video-tool#card-en","repo":"llafztq/dsh-video-tool","commit":"9be77de28cb57034217615dfd40143800bdd3841","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-video-tool adds nine ffmpeg tools to DSH for media inspection, trimming, joining, audio edits, subtitles, transforms, format export, and frame extraction. It handles MP4, WebM, GIF, and audio. If ffmpeg/ffprobe are missing, it downloads and caches them locally; users can provide binaries.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:803-976","index.mjs:215-275","index.mjs:489-525"]}
